    "personal_information": "MANISH KUMAR\n91-8683027559\nms.manishsaini25@gmail.com\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/manish-kumar-7506831ba/\nhttps://github.com/manishkumasaini787",
    "experience": "Experience\nAscent Business Technology Software Developer\nJan 2024 - Present Gurugram, Haryana\nDeveloped and optimized reactive forms and configurable components in React, leveraging Hooks, Context API, and custom reusable components, which improved form validation speed and reduced code duplication. • Built scalable, real-time Policy Management module (GRC product) with React and Spring Boot, using state\nmanagement and lazy loading to ensure seamless synchronization and eﬃcient performance.\nFull-Stack Expertise: Implemented backend solutions using Java, Spring boot leds to improving API response time by 25% and Designed and implemented responsive user interfaces, configurable form with React js which leading to a 15% improvement in user satisfaction.\nExecuted client change requests by analyzing requirements and delivering UI/UX enhancements in React with WebSockets-driven live updates, ensuring 100% on-time delivery.\nResolved frontend and backend bugs by debugging React components, state issues, and API interactions deliver high-quality solutions.\nQA Infotech Software Engineer\nFeb 2022 - Aug 2022 Noida, UP, India • Built RESTful APIs using Spring Boot for CRUD operations with proper HTTP status codes, exception handling and\nsecured REST APIs with JWT-based authentication",
    "education": "Education\nDIT University Bachelor of Technology(B.Tech) in Mechanical Engineering\n2016 - 2020 Dehradun, India\nNIIT StackRoute Institute Full-Stack Software Development\nOct 2022 - Nov 2023",
    "skills": "Technical Skills\nLanguages: JAVA, JavaScript, HTML, CSS Technologies: Spring Boot, React JS, Angular, Microservices, MySQL, RESTful API, Hibernate, Docker, MongoDB, GIT Concepts: Problem Solving, Unit Testing, Debugging and Troubleshooting",
    "projects": "Projects\nKanBan Board | React, MySQL, Spring Boot, Microservices, MongoDB\nA kanban board is an agile project management tool designed to help visualize work and maximize eﬃciency, using React, MySQL, Spring Boot Application.\nBuilt reusable React components for task cards, lists, and modals, improving code maintainability UI consistency and reusability.\nImplemented real-time updates with WebSockets to sync task status across multiple users simultaneously. • Integrated backend microservices with React frontend via REST APIs, ensuring smooth task creation, assignment, and tracking.\nSongPlay(SPOTIFY) Music Application | Spring Boot, React, MySQL\nCreated a music streaming interface in React where users can browse tracks and manage playlists. • Implemented React Router for seamless navigation and Integrated REST APIs to fetch and manage music data, ensuring a smooth and fast user experience."
